- Yes, ma'am.

1350
01:51:57.547 --> 01:51:59.630
- Good.
- He was rescued on time.

1351
01:52:00.047 --> 01:52:02.380
We need officers like Mr. Patnaik.

1352
01:52:02.755 --> 01:52:03.130
